  "message_id": "BTL_MES_H124_058_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 05 01 01 01 05 01 71 01}啊……顺平中毒了。\n这没问题吗？\n{F2 26 00 00}{00}"
 },
 {
